  "description": "On one rainy day, Dana takes Daisy, distraught among a pile of trash, under her wing. Dana brings Daisy to , the strip club she works at. It's a small, shabby club stuck within the slums, but it has a lot of patrons because the club provides its customers with something \"extra\". It doesn't take long for Daisy, the new star stripper, to become the patrons' most coveted. But all she wants is true love. Looking for pure affection in a dark alley where none of the men can provide, Daisy asks Dana to be the manager of her love life. At the dazzling scene of a strip club, what awaits our two heroines?!\n\n(Source: Copin Comics)",
